msgctxt "236"
msgid "Amazing, buddy! You're the best mahjong player in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "From now on, you're going to have to defend your title."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Mahjong players will work their way up the ranks in order to challenge the "
"best player. As of right now, that's you!"
msgstr ""
"I giocatori di mahjong scaleranno le classifiche per sfidare il giocatore "
"migliore. E in questo momento, quello sei tu!"

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I wonder how long you can hold onto your position at the top..."
msgstr ""
"Mi chiedo per quanto tempo riuscirai a mantenere la tua posizione in "
"vetta..."

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Keep battling any who may take you on, you're the best mahjong player we've "
"got here in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""
"Continua a combattere contro chiunque ti sfidi! Sei il miglior giocatore di "
"mahjong che abbiamo qui a Kamurocho!"

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hey, good job."
msgstr "Ehi, bel lavoro."

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"It looks like you've been working up a sweat defending your title. Keep it "
"up!"
msgstr ""
"Sembra che tu stia sudando sette camicie per difendere il tuo titolo. "
"Continua così!"

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Hey, good job."
msgstr "Ehi, bel lavoro."

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Come on back whenever you want to try climbing the ranks."
msgstr "Torna quando vuoi per provare a scalare la classifica."

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Here, we hold the Rising Dragon Cup, where players compete to determine the "
"best mahjong player in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""
"Qui si tiene la Coppa Genbu di Mahjong, dove i giocatori competono per "
"decretare il migliore di Kamurocho."

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Back again, buddy? Why not give the Rising Dragon Cup a shot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Skilled mahjong players from all over are signing up for it."
msgstr "Si stanno iscrivendo abili giocatori di mahjong da ogni dove."

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"It's 50,000 yen to sign up for the rankings. Once you're signed up, you can "
"play mahjong whenever you want."
msgstr ""
"L'iscrizione alla classifica costa 50.000 yen. Una volta iscritto, puoi "
"giocare a mahjong quando vuoi."

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"You'll be able to earn better and better prizes each time your rank goes up."
msgstr ""
"Potrai guadagnare premi sempre migliori ogni volta che salirai di grado."

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"If you manage to reach the top of the rankings, you'll win somethin' that'll"
" really make your eyes pop."
msgstr ""
"Se riesci a raggiungere la vetta della classifica, vincerai qualcosa che ti "
"lascerà a bocca aperta."

msgctxt "464"
msgid "So how 'bout it? Gonna try and climb your way up the ranks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Hmm... Sure, sign me up."
msgstr "Mmh... Certo, iscrivimi."

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Great! I'm just gonna need 50,000 yen before I can put your name down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "Ecco."

msgctxt "524"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Thanks, man. So, you wanna get started right away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Yeah, I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "Sì, ci provo."

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Well then, good luck, buddy."
msgstr "Bene allora, buona fortuna, amico."

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Not now. I'll come back later."
msgstr "Non ora. Tornerò più tardi."

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"You sure? Well, your name's on the list, so you can play a Ranked Match "
"whenever you feel like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(I don't have enough money...)"
msgstr "(Non ho abbastanza soldi...)"

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What's wrong? Don't got enough?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Well, you can sign up for the rankings whenever you want, so just come back "
"with 50,000 yen when you get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Not now. I'll come back later."
msgstr "Non ora. Tornerò più tardi."

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"You sure? Well, registration's always open, so come back whenever you feel "
"like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Back again, buddy? How's about a Ranked Match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Back again, Champ? Ready to defend your title?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "How about it? Wanna go for a Kamurocho Ranked Match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Yeah, I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "Sì, ci provo."

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Well then, good luck, buddy."
msgstr "Bene allora, buona fortuna, amico."

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Not now. I'll come back later."
msgstr "Non ora. Tornerò più tardi."

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"You sure? Well, your name's on the list, so you can play a Ranked Match "
"whenever you feel like it."
msgstr ""

